# Monte Carlo estimate of pi: error versus sample count

All numbers are from `results/` (cluster outputs on KAUST Ibex, analysis in `code/`); the figure is `figures/error_vs_n.png` (`.pdf`). Details of every job: `results/runs.md`; findings: `results/summary.md`.

## Runs

The three frozen batch scripts were submitted unchanged (SHA-256 matched the manifest). `reserve.sbatch` (job 53951127) was submitted first and ended (CANCELLED, never started) right after the sweep was submitted. `pi_sweep.sbatch` (array 53951131) completed all four tasks.

